# todo_write x4 in one turn: the live "plan" block advances its
# in-progress marker (▸, plan.go's PlanCurrent) and checks off items (✓,
# plan.go's OK) as each call lands, finishing with all three items
# checked off.
# design: Terminal.dc.html:372 (plan glyphs ✓ / ▸ / ○)
#
# Each todo_write in the faux script (testdata/faux/qa/tools-plan-progress.yaml)
# is 2s apart so a real-terminal WAITFOR/SHOT round trip can land inside a
# single state instead of racing straight through to the last one — the
# original 400ms gaps meant the very first screenshot already showed the
# final frame.
@faux testdata/faux/qa/tools-plan-progress.yaml

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
TYPE plan the rate limiter work
KEY enter
WAITFOR /▸\s+read the upload handler/ 20
SHOT plan-first-step
EXPECT /▸\s+read the upload handler/
EXPECT /○\s+add the rate limiter/
WAITFOR /▸\s+add the rate limiter/ 20
SHOT plan-second-step
EXPECT /✓\s+read the upload handler/
EXPECT /▸\s+add the rate limiter/
EXPECT /○\s+wire it into the route/
WAITFOR /▸\s+wire it into the route/ 20
SHOT plan-third-step
EXPECT /✓\s+read the upload handler/
EXPECT /✓\s+add the rate limiter/
EXPECT /▸\s+wire it into the route/
WAITFOR /Plan advanced through all three steps/ 20
SHOT plan-done
EXPECT /✓\s+read the upload handler/
EXPECT /✓\s+add the rate limiter/
EXPECT /✓\s+wire it into the route/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
